//
// Mercenary cloak/mantle mesh. Every cell is a pixel:
// 'l' leather, 'd' dark leather, 'k' seam. No empty cells.
// Open-front drape: darker edges, lighter middle, longer than a vest.
// `flow` lets the hem follow a foot. wrap is 0 so the sheet is not a vest mesh.
